    <summary>Developer-first local task manager with Git-style workflows</summary>
    <description>
Tasklynx is a developer-first local task manager featuring Git-style branch workflows, an interactive terminal-native Kanban dashboard (Ratatui), and a zero-dependency embedded web interface.

### Features
- Local-first JSON store with atomic writes, durability fsync, and cross-process safety lock.
- Interactive terminal dashboard (`tx board`) and web dashboard (`tx web`).
- Git-style branches (`tx branch create`, `tx branch switch`).
- Full import and export in JSON and Markdown formats.
- Single portable binary with alias `tx`.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/peekstore/tasklynx/releases/tag/v0.0.1-beta-2</releaseNotes>
